<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Email Confirmación</title>
<style>
body, table, td, a { -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; }
table, td { mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; }
body { margin:0; padding:0; width:100% !important; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background:#f3f4f6; }
.container { max-width:600px; margin:0 auto; border:1px solid #ddd; background:#ffffff; }
.header { background:#10b981; color:white; text-align:center; padding:20px; font-size:24px; font-weight:bold; }
.content { padding:20px; color:#333333; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5; }
.button { display:inline-block; padding:12px 24px; background:#10b981; color:white; text-decoration:none; border-radius:5px; font-weight:bold; }
.footer { padding:15px; text-align:center; font-size:12px; color:#777777; }
@media screen and (max-width:600px){
  .container { width:100% !important; }
  .header { font-size:20px !important; }
  .content { font-size:14px !important; }
  .button { padding:10px 20px !important; font-size:14px !important; }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<center>
<table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#f3f4f6">
<tr>
<td>
<table class="container" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
<tr><td class="header">Confirmación de Registro</td></tr>
<tr>
<td class="content">
<p>¡Gracias por registrarte! Tu cuenta ha sido creada exitosamente.</p>
<p>Para completar tu perfil, haz clic en el botón a continuación.</p>
<p style="text-align:center;"><a href="#" class="button">Completar Perfil</a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr><td class="footer">Si no realizaste este registro, ignora este correo.</td></tr>
</table>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
</center>
</body>
</html>
